  "title": { "zh": "错峰穿过巡逻闸", "en": "Through the Patrol Gates" },
  "concept": { "zh": "两道巡逻闸 · 两种巡逻节奏 · 10 回合", "en": "Two patrol gates · Two patrol schedules · Ten turns" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "在 10 回合内取走 (7,2) 的电池并抵达出口。两块备用电池可取可留。移动和拾取各花 1 回合，扫描免费。踏进巡逻机器人占据的格子，或在行动后与它同格，都会失败。巡逻从第 0 回合开始，每 6 回合重复。西闸 (3,2) 在第 1、5 回合被占，东闸 (6,2) 在第 1、4 回合被占。同一份程序还要通过西闸改在第 3、5 回合被占的场景。",
    "en": "Pick up the battery at (7,2) and reach the exit within ten turns. The other two batteries are optional. A move or pickup costs one turn and scanning is free. Entering a tile occupied by a patrol or sharing its tile after your action ends the run. Patrols start at turn zero and repeat every six turns. The west gate at (3,2) is occupied on turns 1 and 5. The east gate at (6,2) is occupied on turns 1 and 4. The same program must also handle a west gate occupied on turns 3 and 5 instead."
  },
